              "ImageDescription": {
                "value": "A contract being signed between Oulu city and Oulu Oy at the session room of city government on January 27, 1936. Signing the contract at the end of the table is the mayor of Oulu H. Karjalainen. Also attending the meeting the city secretary J. Sopala (second on the left), engineer N. Kanto (third on the left), forest councillor L. Kivinen (second on the right) and varatuomari Toivo J. Komsi (on the right).",
